WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.860
Hi, Bluebold here!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.060
Some sentences carry luggage they don't need.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.460
Today we throw out the extra bags.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.020
But only the extra ones.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.260
The final outcome was clear.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.800
Look at final,

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.780
and outcome. An outcome is already how things ended up.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.420
So final is just repeating.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.440
Drop it. The outcome was clear.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.140
Same meaning, fewer words.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.520
That's concise.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.280
Concise means removing repeated meaning,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.780
while keeping every detail,

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.080
and the grammar.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.840
Your turn. We returned back home.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.280
Which word is extra?

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.180
Go.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.720
Back! Returned already means came back.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.080
We returned home.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.920
But shortest is not automatically right.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.380
The store closes at nine on weekdays.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.260
Cut on weekdays,

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.160
and it's shorter,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.420
but you lost information.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.640
Those words were doing a job.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.980
The right answer keeps the meaning,

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.600
the grammar, and the emphasis the question asks for.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.060
So compare the meaning of each word.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:13.200
Only remove words that add nothing.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:14.760
Then read the whole new sentence,

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.340
to be sure it still works.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.240
Repeat? Cut it.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.040
New information? Keep it.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.960
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:23.880
and go pack light!
